          "kind": "measured",
          "note": "The style's own typical_ratios give 3:12 to 6:12 -- one step steeper at the top than the parent's inherited 5:12 ceiling."
        }
      },
      "note": "Only the maximum changes; the parent's 3:12 floor, its eave-overhang and clay-tile figures all inherit correctly.",
      "status": "drafted"
